?t=1755051715\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras_big/93987bb8d5397ea9a63da225d4189e28.avif?t=1755051715 width=800 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/5843562f5069f94a873a2927c432c5f1.avif?t=1755051715\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras_big/5843562f5069f94a873a2927c432c5f1.avif?t=1755051715 width=800 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/8366036559b097c764c1564e34a522a9.avif?t=1755051715\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras_big/8366036559b097c764c1564e34a522a9.avif?t=1755051715 width=800 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/69d8f83b3a0a99aa29b7f6b6d9742f22.avif?t=1755051715\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras_big/69d8f83b3a0a99aa29b7f6b6d9742f22.avif?t=1755051715 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Succession to the throne</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one can resist the temptation of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will play the role of an heir to a kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the kingdom to greatness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Facing difficulties</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continuation of the kingship is not smooth sailing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless difficulties are coming one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to carefully balance all aspects of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasury, army, people, resources, diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Make a choice-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make will affect the future of your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a wise ruler who loves his people like his own children, or one who will do anything to achieve his goals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you like it or not, you need to make changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Multiple endings</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each kingdom has its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the kingdom fall? Or rise? Or disappear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's all up to you to decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you are interested in this game, you may click Add to Wishlist! It will be convenient to receive game releases, discounts, and the latest news at the first time!</strong></p>","developers":["huiFeng"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/header.jpg?t=1755051715","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3052480/834654/af76a649dd67cde195ff25f7dd8944c23ab93029/1750970834/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742821773","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3052480/834654/af76a649dd67cde195ff25f7dd8944c23ab93029/1750970834/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742821773","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3052480/834654/af76a649dd67cde195ff25f7dd8944c23ab93029/1750970834/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742821773","id":257101958,"name":"EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam